<globals>
	<!-- Design tokens for the TempCtl UI. Reference consts as #name, fonts by
	     name, styles with <style name="..."/>.

	     Fonts are exported as C (fonts/*_data.c); src/ui_gen.c gives each one
	     LVGL's built-in Montserrat as fallback for missing characters (it
	     also has the FontAwesome symbols).

	     Colours: see the palettes below. Widgets get their colours only
	     through named styles, so the palette can be switched at runtime. -->

